\title{Webmania SDK reference objects}
\description{Typed reference objects, explicit sensitive data reveal, scoped clients and cancellable tasks. See the installed README and api-metadata.json for the complete contract and limits.}
\details{Never pass binary floating point values to monetary fields. Number takes an exact JSON number lexeme. Use R integer values or wm_integer64 for signed64 fields. wm_text accepts raw UTF8 bytes including NUL. wm_null is explicit nullable presence; NULL is missing. All setters mutate reference objects. Poll is nonblocking; await catches R interrupts, cancels and joins, preserving backend errors. Explicit close is deterministic and finalizers release abandoned resources.}
